\begin{thm}\label{thm:pm1}  Let $(M^n,g)$, $4 \le n \le 7$, be a complete orientable ALH manifold with a conformally compactifiable toroidal end $\calE$, 
and with scalar curvature $R \ge -n(n-1)$.  Suppose further that $N = \overline{M\setminus\calE}$ is noncompact and asymptotically retractible onto $\d\cal{E}$. Then the mass of the end $\calE$ is nonnegative. 
